+{"version":1,"themeId":"kivotos-1111","sourceVersion":"1.1.11","implementation":"独立重建；非恢复的 1.2.6 原版工程","roles":[{"id":"airi","name":"栗村 爱莉","aliases":["栗村 爱莉","栗村爱莉","Kurimura Airi","KurimuraAiri"],"academy":"trinity","profile":"## 角色信息 ##\r\n姓名：栗村 爱莉（别名：Kurimura Airi）   年龄：15岁 性别：女 生日：1月30日 身高：160cm 爱好：探访甜点店、茶会\n## 人物介绍 ##\r\n三一综合学园所属，放学后的甜点部的开朗成员（部长），在“Suger Rush”乐队中兼任队长，高中一年级学生。个性悠然自得，最重视和朋友一边享用甜点一边聊天的时光。喜欢的东西是冰淇淋，最近迷上了薄荷巧克力的滋味。\r\n因为喜爱冰淇淋这类甜点而加入圣三一甜点部，在甜点部里，与其他成员一样喜欢品尝各式甜点，还与其他人分享甜点，并一同协作帮助别人、击退不良学生。爱莉不仅是乐队创建的提议人，还是乐队的队长。在乐队里，虽有一点放弃自我的思想，但看到夏“窃取”的一小部分女王泡芙后重拾信心。\r\n必须要吃巧克力薄荷味甜点的栗村爱莉平时表现随和，但在喜欢的事物上会表现出固执腹黑的一面，喜欢在MomoTalk中使用颜文字。实际上是放学后的甜点部的创立者（不是部长，在成立甜点部时根据其“想与大家平等相处”的要求而未设立部长职位，哪怕是在乐队活动结束后也不愿意接受这一点）。\r\n武器：清爽薄荷巧克力（原型：MP5K冲锋枪）","defaultVariant":"normal","background":"thrinity/BG_TrinityCampus","preview":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/preview/airi.webp","variants":[{"id":"hallowmas","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/hallowmas/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/hallowmas/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/hallowmas/NP0227_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"music","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/music/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/music/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/music/CH0251_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"normal","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/normal/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/normal/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/airi/normal/airi_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]}]},{"id":"ako","name":"天雨亚子","aliases":["天雨亚子"],"academy":"gehenna","profile":"## 人物信息 ##\n姓名：天雨亚子  年龄：17岁  性别：女  身高：165cm 生日：12月22日  爱好：空崎日奈\n## 人物介绍 ##\r\n亚子是格黑娜学院高三生，风纪委员会的行政官、二号人物，风纪委员长空崎日奈的秘书，总是在日奈的身边辅佐她，工作能力极强，看起来好像是一名温柔善良的少女，但对违反规章的人丝毫不会手下留情，在格黑娜常被人称为“日奈的宠物”，但她本人对此并不在意。负责风纪委员会的行政事务管理、作战指挥与风纪委员长的日程管理，以及应对格黑娜学院学生会“万魔殿”推给风纪委员会的大事小情。在委员长缺勤时代行职务，而且有单独调动风纪委员会兵力的权力。\r\n从表面上看，亚子是一位彬彬有礼非常擅长应对职场与交际的女性，而私下里性格相当高傲绝不轻易示弱，且时常疑神疑鬼有些神经质。在风纪委员会，她对自己和他人都很严格。这使她在日奈不在的时候成为完美团队的优秀管理者，但也可能使她在巨大压力下变得偏执和行为不端。\r\n虽然亚子并不是最优秀的学生之一，也很难与其他人合作，但她确实是好意，为了日奈和格黑娜全力以赴，以至于她对同学们的担心会造成不必要的压力。\r\n武器：Hot Shot，原型为鲁格P08炮兵型。","defaultVariant":"normal","background":"gehna/BG_GehennaCampus","preview":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/preview/ako.webp","variants":[{"id":"dress","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/dress/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/dress/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/dress/CH0231_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","14","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"gymsuit","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/gymsuit/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/gymsuit/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/gymsuit/NP0059_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","14","15","16","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"normal","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/normal/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/normal/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/normal/ako_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","14","15","16","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"speical","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/speical/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/speical/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/ako/speical/NP0111_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","14","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]}]},{"id":"aliceprincess","name":"AL-1S","aliases":["AL-1S"],"academy":"millennium","profile":"## 人物信息 ##\n姓名：AL-1S 年龄：未知 性别：女 生日：无/不记得 身高：152cm\n## 人物外观 ##\n头部：深蓝黑色极长发，发尾带灰蓝和青绿色渐变，发量巨大，长度接近脚边并在身后像波纹般展开。前额有一束长刘海垂落，遮住部分面部，使表情更沉静。她戴深色发箍。眼睛为粉红色，虹膜明亮，神情空灵、平静、近乎无悲无喜，但在触及老师、名字、游戏或学生时会短暂露出疑惑。\n上身：穿深黑色王女礼服，白色翻领与袖口形成强烈对比。胸前有白色褶饰和一枚蓝色宝石胸针，像旧王朝纹章、核心接口或封印节点。袖子宽大，动作幅度小时像被仪式服束住，动作幅度大时又像黑色羽翼张开。\n下身：深色伞状长裙，裙摆宽而沉，边缘有细线装饰。腿部穿白袜，脚上是深色玛丽珍鞋。整体没有千年学生制服的日常感，而是“被供奉”的礼服感。\n## 人物介绍 ##\n与天童爱丽丝同源，却不是现时间线的爱丽丝，也不是已经独立为柯伊的 Kei。她来自基沃托斯毁灭的一周目，是被唤醒王女使命、执行“终止一周目当时的现行文明，重建无名众神统治”之命，又在色彩灾厄之后仍然残留自我与记忆的 AL-1S，因为不知名的原因在如今降临到本条世界线。\nAL-1S 是“如果爱丽丝没有成为爱丽丝”的结果。她没有被桃井和绿带进游戏开发部，没有从 RPG、伙伴和老师那里学会“成为勇者”的道路，也没有因为柯伊的牺牲而重新选择学生身份。她所拥有的是更完整的王女权限、更沉重的无名众神知识，以及一周目毁灭所留下的空白。\n她是无名祭司追随的，被无名众神创造的王女、接口、放大器和王座载体。她本应在“钥匙”引导下履行存在义务，接入阿特拉哈西斯方舟，将旧时代的神性与毁灭程序扩展到整个基沃托斯，使命本身就是终止无名众神消失后一周目基沃托斯建立起来的现行文明。","defaultVariant":"normal","background":"millennium/BG_MilleniumCampus","preview":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/preview/aliceprincess.webp","variants":[{"id":"normal","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/alice_princess_body.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/00.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/01.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/02.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/03.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/04.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/05.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/06.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/07.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/08.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/09.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/10.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/11.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/12.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/13.png","/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/aliceprincess/normal/14.png","/media-cache/card-assets/re