,"01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","14","15","16","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]}]},{"id":"koyuki","name":"黑崎小雪","aliases":["黑崎小雪","黒崎 コユキ Kurosaki Koyuki","黒崎コユキKurosakiKoyuki"],"academy":"millennium","profile":"## 角色信息 ##\n姓名：黑崎小雪（别名：黒崎 コユキ Kurosaki Koyuki） 年龄：15岁 性别：女 生日：2月14日 身高：149cm 爱好：碰运气、逃脱（偷偷挪用研讨会的预算然后拿去赌博）\n## 人物外观 ##\n形象类型：拥有粉色长发、粉红色眼瞳的少女\n## 人物设定 ##\n隶属于千年科学学园学生会“研讨会”的总惹出麻烦的天才少女。虽然在数学密码的解密方面天赋异禀，但自己完全没意识到这一点\n另外，由于喜欢那些自己无法控制的、与运气密切相关的因素，用各种方法对自己的运气进行着测试。即便因此吃了不少苦头，但仍然乐在其中\n拥有幸运E的体质，表现在涉及运气的游戏一定会输掉。研讨会资金消失的罪魁祸首之一（尽管莉音才是调用资金的大头）。\n因为经常搞事而被研讨会关禁闭，但总能逃出去，然后被抓回来。亲近（准确说是不害怕）优香，害怕诺亚，觉得诺亚对她笑起来的时候最可怕。\n专属武器：二次“机”会（原型：M60E4通用机枪）","defaultVariant":"normal","background":"millennium/BG_MilleniumCampus","preview":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/preview/koyuki.webp","variants":[{"id":"bunnysuit","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/koyuki/bunnysuit/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/koyuki/bunnysuit/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/koyuki/bunnysuit/CH0162_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"normal","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/koyuki/normal/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/koyuki/normal/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/koyuki/normal/CH0198_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.0","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","14","15","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"sleepsuit","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/koyuki/sleepsuit/main.atlas","skeleton":"