心的会计，爱唠叨，并且会毫无顾忌地流露出自己的感情。“这种学院，怎么还不破产！”是她的口头禅，但其实她为了解决阿拜多斯欠下的债务正在偷偷打工，与对策委员会的同学们一起接受不同的委托换取报酬，为负债累累的阿拜多斯财务状况操碎了心，可以说对阿拜多斯的感情很深。\r\n芹香是一名优秀的打工战士，在主线剧情中一直在一家名为“柴关”的拉面店打工，除此之外还在兼职其他工作，毕竟不用上课。主线中多次因为打工而迟到，也有因为打工太累而睡过头的时候，而在个人剧情中几乎每一章节都是在拉着老师四处打工兼职，虽然缺钱，但苦于智商，总是受传销和诈骗所困：在早期先是听信商人欺诈买了大量廉价饰品，救出星野后更是买了显卡想靠挖币赚钱……\r\n武器：Sincerity，茜香出门打工时总会随身携带的突击步枪，枪身永远整备得一尘不染。武器原型是意大利伯莱塔（Beretta）公司研发的AR70突击步枪。","defaultVariant":"normal","background":"abydos/BG_SchoolFrontGate","preview":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/preview/serika.webp","variants":[{"id":"bikingsuit","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/bikingsuit/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/bikingsuit/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/bikingsuit/serika_robber_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"firstmonth","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/firstmonth/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/firstmonth/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/firstmonth/serika_newyear_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.33","animations":["00","01","02","03","04","05","06","07","08","09","10","11","12","13","14","99","Eye_Close_01","Idle_01"],"skins":["default"]},{"id":"gymsuit","atlas":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/gymsuit/main.atlas","skeleton":"/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/gymsuit/main.skel","textures":["/media-cache/card-assets/ready/archive-local-1111/media/assets/spine/serika/gymsuit/NP0047_spr.png"],"spineVersion":"4.2.0","animations":["00","01","02","03","0